{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10517","headline":"留上李右相 · 高适","name":"留上李右相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风俗登淳古，君臣挹大庭。\n深沈谋九德，密勿契千龄。\n独立调元气，清心豁窅冥。\n本枝连帝系，长策冠生灵。\n傅说明殷道，萧何律汉刑。\n钧衡持国柄，柱石总朝经。\n隐轸江山藻，氛氲鼎鼐铭。\n兴中皆白雪，身外即丹青。\n江海呼穷鸟，诗书问聚萤。\n吹嘘成羽翼，提握动芳馨。\n倚伏悲还笑，栖迟醉复醒。\n恩荣初就列，含育忝宵形。\n有窃丘山惠，无时枕席宁。\n壮心瞻落景，生事感浮萍。\n莫以才难用，终期善易听。\n未爲门下客，徒谢少微星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}